  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "地点：密云县城关公社的檀营大队。",
      "output_sha256": "603fdc3b1cef7b58c17e26ca4df691ebc7529e6ebba5f9bc0d37e1fa59d85e34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "603fdc3b1cef7b58c17e26ca4df691ebc7529e6ebba5f9bc0d37e1fa59d85e34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "檀营位于密云县城外东北，约五里。",
      "output_sha256": "34e5c01a3da55f1b45df8b9f6460c08f9aa83d98025adf06029e092b7f37dc5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "34e5c01a3da55f1b45df8b9f6460c08f9aa83d98025adf06029e092b7f37dc5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "原因：我为何要前往檀营？",
      "output_sha256": "21df77d1c2c6b04f6898d104e104d201ea3e021bf63653f431fcda3260aa85dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.5325,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "343b8496410119af45bb539e84010cb8e8e8fa892af2cf007f90cc5d0df3291a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "21df77d1c2c6b04f6898d104e104d201ea3e021bf63653f431fcda3260aa85dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这里有不少满、蒙旗人。",
      "output_sha256": "ea2b738875423128370cd54879c2840ec69710611b9e7ca1f8ceec320b4be0e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.833636,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f57361d2d171417de920351406c4c42f40363f8de585c77550c64101ecc2d22b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea2b738875423128370cd54879c2840ec69710611b9e7ca1f8ceec320b4be0e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在辛亥革命之前，这些旗人的主要生计是通过当兵来获得粮食，通常是一家人依靠一个人当兵的军饷来维持生活，日子十分艰难。",
      "output_sha256": "5d9e1298929ae9336c372cd0fd003d83eaa76ecc54a7c74d10b1a251e00616a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.412749,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fdd00d0fd756a20091b7d81218de1c96a21a768f9e9eb82cac40dfc5323b507b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5d9e1298929ae9336c372cd0fd003d83eaa76ecc54a7c74d10b1a251e00616a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "赶到辛亥革命以后，旗兵钱粮停发，生活可就更困难了。",
      "output_sha256": "4dd9111ed53839f6dab4bf2a7ad1c3e10d011495491499e80813bd007443ab1d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "4dd9111ed53839f6dab4bf2a7ad1c3e10d011495491499e80813bd007443ab1d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "旗兵们的技能主要是骑马射箭，缺乏农业和手艺，失去收入后，他们便面临饥饿。",
      "output_sha256": "7d9f305574d30cb5a7fb64ca6b041d3cfe2959f349029986e1224d8cdb0b471c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.350255,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7c5f6147da05299488ffa737b12fdc63ea4acfebf91b9cb3a33f0dc74d15a551"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d9f305574d30cb5a7fb64ca6b041d3cfe2959f349029986e1224d8cdb0b471c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们的子弟呢，只有少数的念过书，或学过手艺，可以找点工作；大多数的青年既无文化，又不善于劳动，只好去做些小生意，往往连自己也养不活。",
      "output_sha256": "716ba2d6f2ebe6bb2f35e46689b3a16f6779b0f333ce6401947ff42183c942df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "716ba2d6f2ebe6bb2f35e46689b3a16f6779b0f333ce6401947ff42183c942df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "原来，清朝皇帝对旗人的要求，就是只准报效朝廷，不许自谋生计。",
      "output_sha256": "a1a2436c36bd4981bb964f34860824a694999ed76899987ace9d6966ea7f36ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1a2436c36bd4981bb964f34860824a694999ed76899987ace9d6966ea7f36ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这就难怪他们不善于劳动了。",
      "output_sha256": "8f65cc3f0d7804032106ed67b751f9d2a1d4d79c637d4d76cb49ee9fe7e5625c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f65cc3f0d7804032106ed67b751f9d2a1d4d79c637d4d76cb49ee9fe7e5625c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "辛亥革命呢，又有点笼统地仇视一切满人。",
      "output_sha256": "31e9ba205c34b0db0398e4b72593b32afb8ca8a68cebfb8a000b702d5f29301e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "31e9ba205c34b0db0398e4b72593b32afb8ca8a68cebfb8a000b702d5f29301e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这么一来，整整齐齐的檀营就慢慢地变成“叫花子营”了！",
      "output_sha256": "fd847f4242a6e38e06e4a84fac9d8168af0c8e68ada761b3679dcd6230f7ceb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd847f4242a6e38e06e4a84fac9d8168af0c8e68ada761b3679dcd6230f7ceb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有的人实在当无可当，卖无可卖，便拆毁了营房，卖了木料；有的甚至卖儿卖女！",
      "output_sha256": "a31b93b350ba6d66d29f9077a46fd95bd6e4a87aae206dc577da063d545b57b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "a31b93b350ba6d66d29f9077a46fd95bd6e4a87aae206dc577da063d545b57b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "拆典当卖，死走逃亡，悲惨万状。",
      "output_sha256": "e97ecbb135a9981e9f1ccac6813713a352fe1a46153db8ccc7b69d19913fb14a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "e97ecbb135a9981e9f1ccac6813713a352fe1a46153db8ccc7b69d19913fb14a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "檀营原本有两千户满、蒙旗人，是乾隆四十五年从北京调来的，负责皇帝避暑和狩猎时的护卫工作。",
      "output_sha256": "cecd4c99b16da769a248fd7f56df6c4919d90ecd36f8339092f327e70d5de601",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.582325,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c4afcc0180ad0dc7c966e989834f1d0c41fe0247ac35b9b1f33fbbd7bd3532a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cecd4c99b16da769a248fd7f56df6c4919d90ecd36f8339092f327e70d5de601",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而到了新中国成立时，仅剩下二百多户，生活极为艰难。",
      "output_sha256": "f897a6b5ccac2a167cbdb22303961e8666759ae7c848aaf5bc1d526975dd9514",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.421112,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d5b24eab712451ec0e47341c11788d08b3178ad085194a86c80253d3be8593f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f897a6b5ccac2a167cbdb22303961e8666759ae7c848aaf5bc1d526975dd9514",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，我要去看看他们今天是怎样活着呢。",
      "output_sha256": "6d4e61b3e63bac95885bfb33f30ca5df4a32f49665eddcb0781e6059afaf1eb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d4e61b3e63bac95885bfb33f30ca5df4a32f49665eddcb0781e6059afaf1eb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "当前状况：解放后，他们分得了土地，从无业者转变为拥有土地的农民，这是一大变化！",
      "output_sha256": "b2f5d4d99a93d21e1b4253f2d608f23f1cd3ef2b1889d03ec17aaa177698ec98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.695784,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "57f4efd9f8d61c10f7bd7b6179e966c5a879518888d4f17570f3cecefa41b21a",
        "ce0d832c81500a3c2b997cd3af60cc0cb7d9dc03a07f32ad3e5089aa04f3ca96"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b2f5d4d99a93d21e1b4253f2d608f23f1cd3ef2b1889d03ec17aaa177698ec98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "分得了土地，他们可是不会耕种。",
      "output_sha256": "b3fb59df8026265b13953582914198ee18b1b91ebbb9c27cd12f0c11f5d51e8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "b3fb59df8026265b13953582914198ee18b1b91ebbb9c27cd12f0c11f5d51e8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "汉人教给了他们耕作技术，政府帮助他们添置了农具，买了牲口。",
      "output_sha256": "b1931befa0e4ead510149ae721709d6c3fd2775d0d5642f5aefbaa875842977f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1931befa0e4ead510149ae721709d6c3fd2775d0d5642f5aefbaa875842977f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们逐渐掌握了农业技能，从不懂劳动转变为能够劳动。",
      "output_sha256": "c4d20b061f31397277c264ea326be43fb14a0a629e7381a49c2c254342f76fda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.594405,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f583f0a92f5b36ad501f29916c1af08127ff3300f7aa32f5d12497cc7718397f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4d20b061f31397277c264ea326be43fb14a0a629e7381a49c2c254342f76fda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "随着农业合作化运动，他们先后办起了互助组与公社，年年增产，有了信心，由会劳动变为热爱劳动。",
      "output_sha256": "2cd8963d558d823a3bd689e3693524a2361ccecb7d11f3178a20295b9249a8f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "2cd8963d558d823a3bd689e3693524a2361ccecb7d11f3178a20295b9249a8f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那些位孤苦的老人，因壮年时贫困，无力结婚，没人照应，今天都得到照顾。",
      "output_sha256": "f6a93c3d690a8eb404c1d8094573d2efd40d1c40aa6d13e9c04a8d38fe042bf3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6a93c3d690a8eb404c1d8094573d2efd40d1c40aa6d13e9c04a8d38fe042bf3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "孩子们呢，村里有两处小学，可以去读书。",
      "output_sha256": "7ff855a6207790ecbdb9ddd0801fa120e0bcc3ba41494845e665ff5ba068dc4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ff855a6207790ecbdb9ddd0801fa120e0bcc3ba41494845e665ff5ba068dc4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大队里人多地少，就搞些副业，增加收入。",
      "output_sha256": "e3d4a137122b723119db0ef90ed3478721ed8f6f2aa9ae71386d0585b26fb881",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "e3d4a137122b723119db0ef90ed3478721ed8f6f2aa9ae71386d0585b26fb881",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "政府还修建了大渠，将水库的水引进来，促进了田地的灌溉和增产。",
      "output_sha256": "0f61331ce8d08a90872f1f56d39ea9279dfa8640ea6d722d9d4485384e608e64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.516645,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ade03947f4c519f6333fbff7c82f81ae283e185691b1eeca009dc1d2d8b0d65b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f61331ce8d08a90872f1f56d39ea9279dfa8640ea6d722d9d4485384e608e64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "老的营房或加以修补，或另建新房，新房都既坚固又敞亮。",
      "output_sha256": "18068f8eb2f6df5084a0cdeeb0556f2649420f1bf7613016e1018c08f40d0ee9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "18068f8eb2f6df5084a0cdeeb0556f2649420f1bf7613016e1018c08f40d0ee9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我所访问的农家里，院子里养着鸡、猪，种着玉米、红薯，或果树和青菜，村里还安装了电灯。",
      "output_sha256": "c75fddb5b9946d50f4337d74edcb99f110c2a6b90da4423dba6be9f5880c8579",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.678966,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a53c23ab20f5fdbde29757e802ad2fceb0f66b33d0e4b2b8e23f16184ec3233c",
        "dd1574f7fbb653ecaf951b2e52aa323d49e1ba0e101ce6cdd2b18be8af8897ed"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c75fddb5b9946d50f4337d74edcb99f110c2a6b90da4423dba6be9f5880c8579",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "感想：以上这些简要的事实，却蕴含着深刻的意义。",
      "output_sha256": "7d7cad1fc4d10ea1f623299340a8503e304022229fbb061a1a97bc7318058b26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.581818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5c59c42fb8093dd413483beb4b51f18fd5fd0cb34eb4b924c8744a0c6e5b0e69"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d7cad1fc4d10ea1f623299340a8503e304022229fbb061a1a97bc7318058b26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "劳动救活了一大群已快饿死的人，起死回生！",
      "output_sha256": "909c1574dfcdc5e4fd96b33b55cfa75c2237facef8b35f618139ac603afcd5e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "909c1574dfcdc5e4fd96b33b55cfa75c2237facef8b35f618139ac603afcd5e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在辛亥革命以前，满、蒙旗人以当兵吃粮为业，管钱粮叫做铁杆庄稼。",
      "output_sha256": "7b8dd16a38ffa3aece08ec87072c752ca8384e1910f78ec9b22bc7b7ddc71805",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b8dd16a38ffa3aece08ec87072c752ca8384e1910f78ec9b22bc7b7ddc71805",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "事实上，服兵役的才有一份钱粮，当不上兵的并没有收入，铁杆庄稼并养不活一家人。",
      "output_sha256": "088cfb0a8f56ddbe890e149d5a06c2e126d840b8293496702e6c033d6a45b8d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "088cfb0a8f56ddbe890e149d5a06c2e126d840b8293496702e6c033d6a45b8d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在，在公社制度下，只要肯参加集体生产劳动，全家全族就都能吃饱穿暖，幸福日增。",
      "output_sha256": "2d1a5db8c0c59ff9b6e889ed25a88a671af943cfcfe68a0be8506170b6b06af1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d1a5db8c0c59ff9b6e889ed25a88a671af943cfcfe68a0be8506170b6b06af1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "社会主义才是真的铁杆庄稼！",
      "output_sha256": "060144e497cd11ff74f0471b69d1fc733f4cbd00ab64436e42efc9e2e8a6d7ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "060144e497cd11ff74f0471b69d1fc733f4cbd00ab64436e42efc9e2e8a6d7ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一位七十岁的满族老人说得好：“在解放前，我看不到任何活路儿，只好等死！",
      "output_sha256": "97a20b2e85156428d4ee8fe669726955f46ae7690293601a4297e69fc5896edb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "97a20b2e85156428d4ee8fe669726955f46ae7690293601a4297e69fc5896edb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，从第一回看到解放军，我就看明白：我又活了！",
      "output_sha256": "252bb5c2e272676f9bf09581b82181016579d15c758e14004e53112a2ddd5eb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "252bb5c2e272676f9bf09581b82181016579d15c758e14004e53112a2ddd5eb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从那时起，我就决定听党的话，听毛主席的话，怎么做我就怎么做！”",
      "output_sha256": "36be88c045cccba417b44bebb57a90a3718a116125c05b0694491084893dffb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.605801,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c57850a80f4c27156b6197bfb389009a2d5c652ca3cf873e69811dfb252c9bfa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36be88c045cccba417b44bebb57a90a3718a116125c05b0694491084893dffb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，这位老人便是办互助组与公社的积极分子之一。",
      "output_sha256": "328f2a9d3ed86a156c2136ef4a0c79f91ff37532e13dbac307208f37802cd043",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "328f2a9d3ed86a156c2136ef4a0c79f91ff37532e13dbac307208f37802cd043",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在，他已年高体弱，不能劳动了。",
      "output_sha256": "98b692bfa79481b53ae3981296c53e99d7902f65bd38fd39c34ef1009de8ac14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "98b692bfa79481b53ae3981296c53e99d7902f65bd38fd39c34ef1009de8ac14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，他的声音还是那么响亮，时常用他的话鼓舞社员们积极生产，爱护集体。",
      "output_sha256": "9c43d3a987ca75cdeae6feab6c73e5ffbf6fef74ec115a87aea456f9ae1e35c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c43d3a987ca75cdeae6feab6c73e5ffbf6fef74ec115a87aea456f9ae1e35c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我相信，他的心声代表了大队中所有满、蒙旗人对党和毛主席的感激之情。",
      "output_sha256": "990b4621121551388c357c4651914078caf80889ce43ae0e9964f926beae576c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.567608,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f49ad19faef9d1e9a349872ddcd7e79946a3f4ce6d3837f0bd4c3f17443a79c8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "990b4621121551388c357c4651914078caf80889ce43ae0e9964f926beae576c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在北京，我见到了许多满、蒙族的亲戚朋友，了解到他们如何在解放后从失业转为就业，从衣不遮体到吃饱穿暖。",
      "output_sha256": "3396762eb08a7031bd3531ffbe08c8d5469c92eacfebed7ca134cb2bf24bb516",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.644756,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4946bd9163c3a55637ef15d11fe1f4be9ef56f1146a3e9eb320e28e930896e10"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3396762eb08a7031bd3531ffbe08c8d5469c92eacfebed7ca134cb2bf24bb516",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，这些人与事都是分散的，东一个西一个的。",
      "output_sha256": "be68d07eb981ed71c7cefa5c66717595c69ab3db928b82bf21ca710ec7e14b2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "be68d07eb981ed71c7cefa5c66717595c69ab3db928b82bf21ca710ec7e14b2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "虽然由每一个这样的人与事上，都能使我联想到分散在全国各地的满、蒙旗人全会得救，可是我心中到底似乎缺少一个更具体更鲜明更大一些的事例。",
      "output_sha256": "54477c24a0837a1019fb34a0d6f953ea3e3e397c2768970290e76e39251eb295",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "54477c24a0837a1019fb34a0d6f953ea3e3e397c2768970290e76e39251eb295",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在檀营，我找到了这样的榜样。",
      "output_sha256": "0f787e2101f9a5f2efb511c08d3a3dc616231d41b7355685209126daea934194",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.807692,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "56a6fe4651d5c890a137d2f432dbb3e7f6f82d4e69722278907a15fdecec741b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f787e2101f9a5f2efb511c08d3a3dc616231d41b7355685209126daea934194",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这里还有二百多户满、蒙旗人，有的仍住在二百多年前建造的营房里，有的老太太还保持着传统的旗髻。",
      "output_sha256": "472f6922f42be3ed78236df4c2eb9a91aab4f0b88c965bb591a5d0e560df7493",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.72714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e1eb50716de8139627ec35aeda40aba52f07561e7ae2b20109af47d842a58c9d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "472f6922f42be3ed78236df4c2eb9a91aab4f0b88c965bb591a5d0e560df7493",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有了这个较大的例子，我能够更具体地向全世界说明：看，在中华人民共和国中，我们满、蒙旗人又活了，而且活得愉快而有意义，因为我们与其他民族的兄弟姐妹共同劳动，共同建设社会主义！",
      "output_sha256": "db2742b3a24e8baf9a62ed0ff40564ec99ba99179fd376c1592e44fbd8872881",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.734843,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09570c236dc6cc75cb309aac648e175faa4e9c018be0ffae27536102fd164cf8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "db2742b3a24e8baf9a62ed0ff40564ec99ba99179fd376c1592e44fbd8872881",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是多么了不起的事啊！",
      "output_sha256": "6d83cf3d4e432e0234066b5d8047edc370b6f0008da56c3ec4ea930069f550db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d83cf3d4e432e0234066b5d8047edc370b6f0008da56c3ec4ea930069f550db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好，我要再多去看看，据说在西山面前，在东陵……也有满、蒙旗人在公社里劳动，过着幸福的生活。",
      "output_sha256": "47cc413f67846f16604d54b57019aa77398796a192ad88f85df5e82c7cf8c151",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "47cc413f67846f16604d54b57019aa77398796a192ad88f85df5e82c7cf8c151",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我要去看看，并希望写出些文章来，证明新中国各民族的人民如何团结，如何平等，如何欢快，如何热烈爱戴党与毛主席！",
      "output_sha256": "5ae3c22271f8e6627833191d18575556b571403fb667f9d04886f75bff0429bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
